-Documentation version: 0.5.1 (2026-10-26)
+## Bulk import
+
+Use `importTasks(list, text)` to bring spreadsheet rows into a task list. Each nonblank row is
+`title;priority;tags`; leave `priority` empty for normal priority and separate tags with spaces. It
+adds every valid row and returns the count imported plus one-based line numbers and reasons for rejected
+rows, without stopping at a rejected row.
+
